're starting to see that percolate through the system.\"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Feeding inflation worries, data on Thursday showed U.S. producer prices increased more than expected in May, leading to the largest annual gain in over three years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;:: Oracle&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Among the day's stock moves, shares of Oracle bucked what was otherwise a strong day for tech stocks, plunging 8.5% after the firm projected capital spending plans for fiscal 2027 above Wall Street estimates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And shares of Adobe, down more than 6% at the close, plunged further in extended trading, despite the Photoshop maker raising its annual revenue forecast. The company also announced the departure of its CFO only three months after Adobe's CEO said he would step down.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And SpaceX priced the biggest-ever U.S. IPO at $135 per share, making Elon Musk’s rocket maker one of the world’s most valuable companies. The IPO raised a record $75 billion, valuing the company at nearly $1.8 trillion, a record for an initial offering. Trading is set to begin on Friday.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;", "source": "yahoo_top", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/video/wall-street-indexes-jump-trump-224444033.html?.tsrc=rss", "published_at": "2026-06-11T22:44:44", "sentiment_score": 0.6, "sentiment_label": "POSITIVE", "related_tickers": ["SPY", "QQQ"], "impact_explanation": null, "source_tier": "B", "corroborated_by": 1}, {"headline": "DraftKings Stock Soars as Predictions Volume Explodes. DKNG’s Next Growth Engine Might Just Be Getting Started.", "summary": "", "source": "yahoo_finance", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/draftkings-stock-soars-predictions-volume-154016665.html", "published_at": "2026-06-11T23:07:20.703044", "sentiment_score": 0.8, "sentiment_label": "POSITIVE", "related_tickers": [], "impact_explanation": null, "source_tier": "B", "corroborated_by": 1}, {"headline": "Adobe CFO exit fans strategy worries despite outlook raise", "summary